date: 2025-11-11T00:00:00-04:00
---

The Anti-Zorbon Taskforce was a group of homeless people who lived in the sewers beneath [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Widdershins/index|Widdershins]] rather than on the streets. Its members fashioned hats out of tinfoil to keep the Zorbon out of their minds, and kept them folded away when out in the open. [[Org/Amber Call/People/Mr. Whiskers|Mr. Whiskers]] was a proud member and was called its head, and the honey seller [[People/Cora Honeysap|Cora Honeysap]] knew him by that role.

The way down to the hideout is a manhole in a small open-air market in Widdershins. The hideout is wrecked. Something strong and clever killed the people there, around ten of them, tore them apart, and carried the bodies away down an underground river. No bodies remain and there is no sign of a struggle. Whiskers' things are among the belongings left behind. Robed spellcasters with pale, hunched creatures have come to the hideout since, to rifle through a boat and the dead's belongings.
